      "consumedBecause": "HT05 (18% camera zoom pulse) produced a P0 false touch. The tracking layer was differencing player-relative positions in pixels and dividing by a single ball diameter, so a global scale change left a residual velocity. Diagnosing and fixing that used these cases, so they are now development material.",
